"help.language" = "--lang en|zh-Hans selects the display language before the command; --lang=zh-Hans is also accepted. Without --lang, use NAGI_LANG, LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES, then LANG; unsupported automatic locales use English. JSON data stays in English.";
